                <div class="panel dlg-preview" aria-hidden="true">
                  <h5>Delete atlas-web?</h5>
                  <p>Removes 14 deployments and 3 domains. Type <b>atlas-web</b> to confirm.</p>
                  <span class="input" style="display:flex;align-items:center;height:36px;color:var(--text-3)">atlas-web</span>
