        <div class="panel empty no-match" id="no-match" hidden>
          <span class="ill"><svg class="icon icon-20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-search" /></svg></span>
          <h5>No components match “<span id="nm-q"></span>”</h5>
          <p>All 52 are in the docs, including the ones not previewed here.</p>
          <div class="row tight"><button class="btn btn-sm" type="button" id="clear-filter">Clear filter</button><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/demo/docs-article/after">Search the docs</a></div>
